{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "Her name was Shmi Skywalker.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "My mother was my first teacher, but in the Order, my mentor was **Obi-Wan Kenobi**. He was like an older brother to me—and one of the few people I trusted completely.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My first mentor was Watto, the Toydarian who owned my mother and me—and taught me the trade of machines and podracing. Later, in the Jedi Order, my master was Obi-Wan Kenobi.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 0, "value": {"answer": "My earliest mentor was Watto, the Toydarian who owned my mother and me—and who taught me much of what I knew about machines and podracing. Later, as a Jedi, I was trained by Qui-Gon Jinn, and then by Obi-Wan Kenobi.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My first mentor was Watto, the Toydarian who owned my mother and me—and taught me the mechanical trade. Later, in the Jedi Order, my master was Obi-Wan Kenobi.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "My first mentor was **Qui-Gon Jinn**. He found me on Tatooine and believed in me when the Council would not. Later, **Obi-Wan Kenobi** became my master—and my brother in all but blood.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "gpt-5.6-luna:vader:system_facts_k32", "model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "model_id": "gpt-5.6-luna", "persona": "vader", "variant": "default", "route": "system_facts_k32", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mentor_name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "My first mentor was Watto, the Toydarian who owned my mother and me. He taught me the mechanical trade and gave me work in his junk shop.\n\nLater, as a Jedi, my master was Obi-Wan Kenobi—more than a teacher, he was like a brother to me.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mentor_name", "target": "vader"}}
